// The committed milestone snapshot — the offline fallback, and nothing else.
//
// Used only when the implementation status file is unreachable at build time,
// so a build (and local dev without network) never fails. When the file is
// reachable it is the only source: the milestones, their names, their order and
// their marks all come from it, and nothing here is consulted.
//
// Generated from lemonfiber/IMPLEMENTATION-STATUS.md with the same parser the
// build uses, so the snapshot renders the page a live build would. Regenerate
// it the same way; do not edit an entry by hand.

